WEBVTT

00:00.030 --> 00:01.440
Do you run ads on Facebook or

00:01.440 --> 00:02.430
TikTok?

00:02.490 --> 00:04.180
A video ad often works for one or

00:04.180 --> 00:05.230
two weeks.

00:05.250 --> 00:06.650
Then you need a new one.

00:06.650 --> 00:08.700
With MakeInfluencer, one photo of

00:08.700 --> 00:10.650
your product becomes a video ad.

00:10.670 --> 00:12.410
The tool gives you two versions, so

00:12.410 --> 00:13.670
you keep the best one.

00:13.670 --> 00:15.340
An AI presenter holds your product

00:15.340 --> 00:16.830
and talks to the camera.

00:16.850 --> 00:18.530
You do not film anything.

00:18.530 --> 00:19.750
You make different openings for the

00:19.750 --> 00:21.690
same video, called hooks.

00:21.710 --> 00:23.690
Then you test which one works best.

00:23.690 --> 00:25.130
Keep the same presenter for all your

00:25.130 --> 00:26.150
products.

00:26.170 --> 00:27.580
She can speak with your own recorded

00:27.580 --> 00:30.470
voice, in English, French or Darija.

00:30.470 --> 00:32.020
Answer the two questions below this

00:32.020 --> 00:33.630
video to choose your plan.
